<section_header_level_1><loc_50><loc_74><loc_449><loc_152>COVID-19 pandemic: from origins to outcomes. A comprehensive review of viral pathogenesis, clinical manifestations, diagnostic evaluation, and management</section_header_level_1>
<text><loc_50><loc_164><loc_432><loc_185>Rohan Kumar Ochani 1 , Ameema Asad 1 , Farah Yasmin 1 , Shehryar Shaikh 1 , Hiba Khalid 1 , Simran Batra 1 , Muhammad Rizwan Sohail 2 , Syed Faisal Mahmood 3 , Rajkumar Ochani 4 , Mohammad Hussham Arshad 5 , Arjan Kumar 6 , Salim Surani 7,8</text>
